{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega/v5.json",
  "description": "Search p99 per 30 s window at 20 searches/s as a multiple of the 31 ms no-writes p99, for two stacked runs (price storm, bulk feed, price storm back to back) from a level start. Line: mean of the two runs; band: their range. Thick steps and headers: the mean of the 30 s p99s in that span, both runs; the writes split at the feed (7.0 to 7.5 min, about 30 s). Stage 0: the 1x reference. Stage 1: the writes. Stage 2: the first 10 minutes after. Stage 3: 10 to 14 minutes after, the seal. Stage 4: 14 to 20 minutes after. Stage 5: a single 10% storm with nothing before or after it (teal); headers fade out, lined up on writes stopping, each run divided by its own no-writes control p99 (29.5 and 30.9 ms). Source: vector_search_ecom results/b4a.json passes 2, 5; reference from passes 0, 7. Storm alone: results/b4d_single_ops.json storm10 passes, both repeats.",
